 "remarks": "Currently set up as a multifamily in a single family zone. Exceptional opportunity in one of Cos Cob's most desirable neighborhoods! This charming two-family offers incredible versatility for investors, builders, and end users. Renovate the existing multifamily or explore conversion into a beautiful single-family residence. With current rents below market, there is immediate income and significant potential to optimize rental revenue. Buyers considering conversion can collect rent to offset carrying costs while pursuing plans and approvals. Features include hardwood floors, spacious living areas, a large rear deck, private backyard, attached garage, and driveway parking. A rare opportunity to unlock value in a sought-after Cos Cob location!",
